# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# Testing
/coverage

# Next.js
/.next/
/out/

# Production Build
/build

# Application Secrets & Local Environments (CRITICAL)
